(3091473, 434714, 66515, '<td valign="top">The effect of the "ghost" is really too subtle to appreciate in this shot. Had you done this shot without it I think it would have been more compelling.</td>', 'The effect of the "ghost" is really too subtle to appreciate in this shot. Had you done this shot without it I think it would have been more compelling.', '2006-12-06 03:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
