(3095822, 435149, 66384, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Didn''t work very well though. The girl in the dark jacket is a little blurred from motion. The ghost effect would work better if there was something in the background to show through the ghost. But I''m giving a decent score because of the effort, and the fact that this totally meets the challenge: "image that explores death".</td>', 'Good idea. Didn''t work very well though. The girl in the dark jacket is a little blurred from motion. The ghost effect would work better if there was something in the background to show through the ghost. But I''m giving a decent score because of the effort, and the fact that this totally meets the challenge: "image that explores death".', '2006-12-07 09:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
