(3095827, 434336, 27514, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I get this image. I like the idea though. <br/> <br/>there are some minor tech. issues here. the ratio between your highlight and your shadow is high, so I''m afraid your losing detail in your blacks and your whites (especially on his head). the focus feels soft also. The necklace needs turned and if you tried to go for a sepia tone it''s a little off and if this is not sepia toned then your color is off.<br/> <br/>aside from that, the image is still puzzling to me. I''m not sure what he is doing.</td>', 'I''m not sure I get this image. I like the idea though.  there are some minor tech. issues here. the ratio between your highlight and your shadow is high, so I''m afraid your losing detail in your blacks and your whites (especially on his head). the focus feels soft also. The necklace needs turned and if you tried to go for a sepia tone it''s a little off and if this is not sepia toned then your color is off. aside from that, the image is still puzzling to me. I''m not sure what he is doing.', '2006-12-07 09:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
