(3096461, 434387, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals: good composition, good lighting. Sharp DOF. I like the star effect.<br/>Feel: There are going to be a zillion graveyard shots.  I''m getting this one very early, but I think it''s gonna have that little extra zip to raise it above the others. <br/>Score: 7</td>', 'Technicals: good composition, good lighting. Sharp DOF. I like the star effect.Feel: There are going to be a zillion graveyard shots.  I''m getting this one very early, but I think it''s gonna have that little extra zip to raise it above the others. Score: 7', '2006-12-07 13:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
