(3096465, 435040, 40718, '<td valign="top">Techicals: Nicely lit steeple.  The tree is fuzzed probably because of a slight breeze and a long exposure.  It also dominates the canvas a bit too much.<br/>Feel: Subtle.  It actually took me 30 seconds to see the graveyard in the corner.  Does have a eerie quality to it.<br/>Score: 6</td>', 'Techicals: Nicely lit steeple.  The tree is fuzzed probably because of a slight breeze and a long exposure.  It also dominates the canvas a bit too much.Feel: Subtle.  It actually took me 30 seconds to see the graveyard in the corner.  Does have a eerie quality to it.Score: 6', '2006-12-07 13:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096469, 435320, 56254, '<td valign="top">love the processing done here ...</td>', 'love the processing done here ...', '2006-12-07 13:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096471, 434350, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals: a bit overexposed.  The sides of the tombstones are quite blown.  Composition isn''t bad, but my eye wants to see at least a little of another row to the right to balance it.<br/>Feel: A bit static.  I guess death is static, but something makes me think a better composition could have been found.<br/>Score: 5</td>', 'Technicals: a bit overexposed.  The sides of the tombstones are quite blown.  Composition isn''t bad, but my eye wants to see at least a little of another row to the right to balance it.Feel: A bit static.  I guess death is static, but something makes me think a better composition could have been found.Score: 5', '2006-12-07 13:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096473, 434162, 44995, '<td valign="top">there''s a lot of noise, and a lack of any sharp focus.</td>', 'there''s a lot of noise, and a lack of any sharp focus.', '2006-12-07 13:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096476, 433849, 69183, '<td valign="top">Everything being out of focus really diminishes the impact this shot has for me - sorry.</td>', 'Everything being out of focus really diminishes the impact this shot has for me - sorry.', '2006-12-07 13:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096481, 434512, 61234, '<td valign="top">In my humble opinion, this one here will be the blue ribbon winner. Why?<br/>Because it''s the best in the lot. Perfect on all levels &gt; 10.</td>', 'In my humble opinion, this one here will be the blue ribbon winner. Why?Because it''s the best in the lot. Perfect on all levels > 10.', '2006-12-07 13:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096484, 434163, 69183, '<td valign="top">The overexposure at the bottom makes it hard to work out what''s happening here; I''m not really sure how this relates to Death.</td>', 'The overexposure at the bottom makes it hard to work out what''s happening here; I''m not really sure how this relates to Death.', '2006-12-07 13:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096487, 435116, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals: soft focus. composition is decent.  Contrast probably works with such a harsh subject.<br/>The feel: I''m not quite sure what is being accomplished here.  It looks like he''s just pointing at the dog.  I''m guessing from the title we are to suspect he "did it", but I''m not getting that feel.<br/>Score: 4</td>', 'Technicals: soft focus. composition is decent.  Contrast probably works with such a harsh subject.The feel: I''m not quite sure what is being accomplished here.  It looks like he''s just pointing at the dog.  I''m guessing from the title we are to suspect he "did it", but I''m not getting that feel.Score: 4', '2006-12-07 13:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096489, 434620, 55908, '<td valign="top">I like that you''ve tried to do something different and unique and the concept is interesting. But perhaps more emphasis on the ice, or just more ice in general, and less sunshine would have really driven the "death" point home. Might also help to really single out the flower from the others and from the background. Nice image though. 8o)</td>', 'I like that you''ve tried to do something different and unique and the concept is interesting. But perhaps more emphasis on the ice, or just more ice in general, and less sunshine would have really driven the "death" point home. Might also help to really single out the flower from the others and from the background. Nice image though. 8o)', '2006-12-07 13:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096492, 434162, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals: decent conversion to B&amp;W, I would have liked a bit more punch, but perhaps the softer background brings the sign out more.  composition is good.  I''d like to see it with a horizontal crop.<br/>Feel: nicely provoking.<br/>Score: 7</td>', 'Technicals: decent conversion to B&W, I would have liked a bit more punch, but perhaps the softer background brings the sign out more.  composition is good.  I''d like to see it with a horizontal crop.Feel: nicely provoking.Score: 7', '2006-12-07 13:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096493, 435209, 44995, '<td valign="top">good idea, could have been done a lot better. would be nice to see more of the body and maybe less noise. Also, I think the title is terrible. the situation in your picture is no joke. i did not hole the title against you in my vote.</td>', 'good idea, could have been done a lot better. would be nice to see more of the body and maybe less noise. Also, I think the title is terrible. the situation in your picture is no joke. i did not hole the title against you in my vote.', '2006-12-07 13:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096494, 433573, 55908, '<td valign="top">Scary! The tone works I think, but the right side being blown out kind of distracts. I do like the movement and the urgency this images conveys though. 8o)</td>', 'Scary! The tone works I think, but the right side being blown out kind of distracts. I do like the movement and the urgency this images conveys though. 8o)', '2006-12-07 13:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096497, 435000, 69610, '<td valign="top">phenomenal....</td>', 'phenomenal....', '2006-12-07 13:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096506, 434213, 69610, '<td valign="top">i don''t find it creative at all...</td>', 'i don''t find it creative at all...', '2006-12-07 13:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096509, 434881, 69183, '<td valign="top">Wow. I think a lot of people are going to be put off this because it''s a cute furry animal. I think it''s a fantastic picture.</td>', 'Wow. I think a lot of people are going to be put off this because it''s a cute furry animal. I think it''s a fantastic picture.', '2006-12-07 13:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096514, 434159, 69610, '<td valign="top">mmmno</td>', 'mmmno', '2006-12-07 13:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096516, 434209, 34255, '<td valign="top">not a very clear image</td>', 'not a very clear image', '2006-12-07 13:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096518, 434336, 55908, '<td valign="top">I took a bit of studying, but I finally realized that the subject has the barral of a gun in his mouth. It was slightly difficult to tell at first, but given the title and challenge, it became apparent. But the lighting is quite nice and the black background sets the mood well. It''s still a bit hard for me, as a viewer, to connect with the subject and really feel what the subject feels though. Seems more emotion/angst in the subject''s face would really drive the point home. But it''s definitely a well done image! 8o)</td>', 'I took a bit of studying, but I finally realized that the subject has the barral of a gun in his mouth. It was slightly difficult to tell at first, but given the title and challenge, it became apparent. But the lighting is quite nice and the black background sets the mood well. It''s still a bit hard for me, as a viewer, to connect with the subject and really feel what the subject feels though. Seems more emotion/angst in the subject''s face would really drive the point home. But it''s definitely a well done image! 8o)', '2006-12-07 13:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096519, 433275, 69610, '<td valign="top">LAME</td>', 'LAME', '2006-12-07 13:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096524, 434715, 34255, '<td valign="top">not the best lighting</td>', 'not the best lighting', '2006-12-07 13:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096534, 434998, 55908, '<td valign="top">What I like: the wonderful textured, gradient from black to white. That does a wonderful job drawing my eye right to the subject and beyond into his infinite future. Buuuttt... the subject feels less sharp than he ought to be. There is also very little detail in the shadows. Not a serious downfall given the type of image, high-contrast works, but I just feel like there could be a bit more technical clarity. It doesn''t give me an immidiate sence of death, but I guess that just gives me a chance to read into it more. Well done overall! 8o)</td>', 'What I like: the wonderful textured, gradient from black to white. That does a wonderful job drawing my eye right to the subject and beyond into his infinite future. Buuuttt... the subject feels less sharp than he ought to be. There is also very little detail in the shadows. Not a serious downfall given the type of image, high-contrast works, but I just feel like there could be a bit more technical clarity. It doesn''t give me an immidiate sence of death, but I guess that just gives me a chance to read into it more. Well done overall! 8o)', '2006-12-07 13:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096548, 434350, 36850, '<td valign="top">Very good perspective shot.</td>', 'Very good perspective shot.', '2006-12-07 13:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096560, 434988, 55908, '<td valign="top">A grave stone does work for the challenge and the message is quite amusing, but I feel like there may have been some more interesting ways to capture this image. Perhaps some dramatic lighting, early in the morning or late in the afternoon; maybe black and white would have worked better. Also think about angle when you''re shooting a static and relatively mundane subject. Like if you shot from really low to the ground, you might have been able to get some decerning billowy clouds or sometihng to spark that mood a bit more. Of course these are just some ideas. The concept works I think, just think about looking at in from all different angles and modes of lighting and consider the meaning of everything that appears in the frame. 8o)</td>', 'A grave stone does work for the challenge and the message is quite amusing, but I feel like there may have been some more interesting ways to capture this image. Perhaps some dramatic lighting, early in the morning or late in the afternoon; maybe black and white would have worked better. Also think about angle when you''re shooting a static and relatively mundane subject. Like if you shot from really low to the ground, you might have been able to get some decerning billowy clouds or sometihng to spark that mood a bit more. Of course these are just some ideas. The concept works I think, just think about looking at in from all different angles and modes of lighting and consider the meaning of everything that appears in the frame. 8o)', '2006-12-07 13:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096562, 433517, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals:  The WB seems a bit on the blue side.  Composition is not bad, although I''m really having trouble with the subject being so small and unidentifiable.<br/>Feel: As mentioned above, I''m not catching the idea of death because whatever is dead, that thing on top, is so small.  I''m not even sure what it is and if I didn''t know this was a "death" challenge wouldn''t be thinking death at all.<br/>Score: 3</td>', 'Technicals:  The WB seems a bit on the blue side.  Composition is not bad, although I''m really having trouble with the subject being so small and unidentifiable.Feel: As mentioned above, I''m not catching the idea of death because whatever is dead, that thing on top, is so small.  I''m not even sure what it is and if I didn''t know this was a "death" challenge wouldn''t be thinking death at all.Score: 3', '2006-12-07 13:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096566, 435000, 34255, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see any sort of artistic merit in this photo.</td>', 'I don''t really see any sort of artistic merit in this photo.', '2006-12-07 13:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096569, 434840, 34255, '<td valign="top">the photo seems too cluttered</td>', 'the photo seems too cluttered', '2006-12-07 13:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096574, 434615, 34255, '<td valign="top">too unnatural.</td>', 'too unnatural.', '2006-12-07 13:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096578, 435116, 55908, '<td valign="top">Well that''s death alright! I don''t really have a problem with gruesome images, but this one is having a lot of trouble technically. I can''t find a single sharp point in it and the selective desaturation doesn''t seem to convey anything a full black and white or full color image wouldn''t, except for the emphasis on blood maybe. But the eye will go there anyway. Double check focus and shutter speed.</td>', 'Well that''s death alright! I don''t really have a problem with gruesome images, but this one is having a lot of trouble technically. I can''t find a single sharp point in it and the selective desaturation doesn''t seem to convey anything a full black and white or full color image wouldn''t, except for the emphasis on blood maybe. But the eye will go there anyway. Double check focus and shutter speed.', '2006-12-07 13:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096599, 435059, 55908, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image but I''m afraid it might be getting hammered by voters in the particular challenge. It''s a technical masterpiece and impeccibly processed. I really like your idea, "A Beautiful Death." It may have been hard with this particular image, but for the sake of really nailing the challenge, it would have been nice to offer some sort of contrasting element within, so that even if I couldn''t see the title, I''d understand what was trying to be conveyed. But very well done! 7. 8o)</td>', 'This is a beautiful image but I''m afraid it might be getting hammered by voters in the particular challenge. It''s a technical masterpiece and impeccibly processed. I really like your idea, "A Beautiful Death." It may have been hard with this particular image, but for the sake of really nailing the challenge, it would have been nice to offer some sort of contrasting element within, so that even if I couldn''t see the title, I''d understand what was trying to be conveyed. But very well done! 7. 8o)', '2006-12-07 13:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096621, 435247, 55908, '<td valign="top">Strong and potent idea, but I can''t help but think the warm skin tones contradict the mood this image is trying to convey. Black and white really would set this off. I like that you were able to create such a simple image that evokes a strong emoting and represents such a complex subject matter. It just needs a more fitting mood in my opinion, to make a really affective connection with viewers. 6 8o)</td>', 'Strong and potent idea, but I can''t help but think the warm skin tones contradict the mood this image is trying to convey. Black and white really would set this off. I like that you were able to create such a simple image that evokes a strong emoting and represents such a complex subject matter. It just needs a more fitting mood in my opinion, to make a really affective connection with viewers. 6 8o)', '2006-12-07 13:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096633, 433682, 34255, '<td valign="top">No artistic merit, low quality image.</td>', 'No artistic merit, low quality image.', '2006-12-07 13:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096638, 435009, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals: The lighting bothers me somehow.  I see you are going for contrasty with the face (and that''s good), but somehow it doesn''t jive with the very low contrast of the background.  Maybe that''s a small nitpick.<br/>The Feel: The blood looks a bit on the "staged" side, but I do like the slightly androgynous feel of the model and outfit.<br/>Score: 5</td>', 'Technicals: The lighting bothers me somehow.  I see you are going for contrasty with the face (and that''s good), but somehow it doesn''t jive with the very low contrast of the background.  Maybe that''s a small nitpick.The Feel: The blood looks a bit on the "staged" side, but I do like the slightly androgynous feel of the model and outfit.Score: 5', '2006-12-07 13:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096639, 434512, 34255, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Best I''ve seen for this challenge.</td>', 'Awesome. Best I''ve seen for this challenge.', '2006-12-07 13:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096647, 435304, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals: Nice composition.  The DOF works well.  The WB is a bit off in my eyes.  Or maybe I''m looking for a different cast to be added.  Lighting works.<br/>The Feel: Does feel like Death although the title is a bit on the head-scratching side.  I know what you are going for, but it seems there is a more eloquent way to put it.<br/>Score: 6</td>', 'Technicals: Nice composition.  The DOF works well.  The WB is a bit off in my eyes.  Or maybe I''m looking for a different cast to be added.  Lighting works.The Feel: Does feel like Death although the title is a bit on the head-scratching side.  I know what you are going for, but it seems there is a more eloquent way to put it.Score: 6', '2006-12-07 13:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096650, 435247, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals:  Composition is a bit cramped.  Focus (probably because of DOF) is a bit soft.<br/>Feel: Is that a letter opener? ;)  It just looks more like that than a knife.  Doesn''t do a whole lot for me (good or bad).<br/>Score: 4</td>', 'Technicals:  Composition is a bit cramped.  Focus (probably because of DOF) is a bit soft.Feel: Is that a letter opener? ;)  It just looks more like that than a knife.  Doesn''t do a whole lot for me (good or bad).Score: 4', '2006-12-07 13:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096653, 435321, 55908, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. The blue funnel is the empty "sands of time" right? It''s a little distracting to me really. Your main death trope is the scull and the rosies are a wonderful accent. Maybe those are the only two elements this images really needed. I think it does a good job illustrating death, but it doesn''t evoke much emotion in me. That emotive response is one of the main things I look for in this challenge, but I''m just one voter. ;o) Still a good image. 8o)</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. The blue funnel is the empty "sands of time" right? It''s a little distracting to me really. Your main death trope is the scull and the rosies are a wonderful accent. Maybe those are the only two elements this images really needed. I think it does a good job illustrating death, but it doesn''t evoke much emotion in me. That emotive response is one of the main things I look for in this challenge, but I''m just one voter. ;o) Still a good image. 8o)', '2006-12-07 13:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096655, 434424, 34255, '<td valign="top">Rather unpleasant.</td>', 'Rather unpleasant.', '2006-12-07 13:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096660, 434914, 34255, '<td valign="top">It would be better if more of the coins were in focus.</td>', 'It would be better if more of the coins were in focus.', '2006-12-07 13:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096665, 435203, 55908, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea! Where better to look for death than to an old western! The sepia was a perfect choice in my opinion. You''ve met the challenge well, established a fitting mood and keep the viewers eye right where it needs to bewithin the edges of the image! Well done! 8o)</td>', 'Excellent idea! Where better to look for death than to an old western! The sepia was a perfect choice in my opinion. You''ve met the challenge well, established a fitting mood and keep the viewers eye right where it needs to bewithin the edges of the image! Well done! 8o)', '2006-12-07 13:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096669, 434250, 55908, '<td valign="top">The shape of this skelton is quite intriguing! That fur ball steels my attention though. What does it mean?</td>', 'The shape of this skelton is quite intriguing! That fur ball steels my attention though. What does it mean?', '2006-12-07 13:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096685, 433370, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice rich color tones and strong composition.  I like the repeating pattern fading off into the distance.  Nice job!</td>', 'Very nice rich color tones and strong composition.  I like the repeating pattern fading off into the distance.  Nice job!', '2006-12-07 13:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
