(3096949, 434336, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals: lighting is decent, conversion isn''t bad, contrast is ok.  All those are probably a bit above average.<br/>Feel: Tough challenge.  This is going to get some reactions and people may vote low due to those reactions.  I feel like it lacks a bit of context.  Sure the guy is getting ready to kill himself, but I don''t have any sense at all as to why.  That''s the trick to a superior picture.<br/>Score: 6</td>', 'Technicals: lighting is decent, conversion isn''t bad, contrast is ok.  All those are probably a bit above average.Feel: Tough challenge.  This is going to get some reactions and people may vote low due to those reactions.  I feel like it lacks a bit of context.  Sure the guy is getting ready to kill himself, but I don''t have any sense at all as to why.  That''s the trick to a superior picture.Score: 6', '2006-12-07 15:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3096952, 434387, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great composition, lovely warm tones and nice use of the sun.  Love the starburst effect. 8</td>', 'Great composition, lovely warm tones and nice use of the sun.  Love the starburst effect. 8', '2006-12-07 15:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
