(3097032, 433275, 40679, '<td valign="top">I like the plastic (not the material plastic) look you got here. the pp might be a bit too much, but the colors are nice.</td>', 'I like the plastic (not the material plastic) look you got here. the pp might be a bit too much, but the colors are nice.', '2006-12-07 15:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097033, 435186, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals: I like the B&amp;W idea but feel the conversion could have been done better to add a bit more drama.  The ribbon on her face is in an unfortunate position and makes it look almost like headgear or something.  Composition is nice although a bit centered.<br/>Feel: I like the feel.<br/>Score: 6</td>', 'Technicals: I like the B&W idea but feel the conversion could have been done better to add a bit more drama.  The ribbon on her face is in an unfortunate position and makes it look almost like headgear or something.  Composition is nice although a bit centered.Feel: I like the feel.Score: 6', '2006-12-07 15:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097037, 435203, 40679, '<td valign="top">the wideangle is a great choice here. might like to see a bit more DoF</td>', 'the wideangle is a great choice here. might like to see a bit more DoF', '2006-12-07 15:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
