(3097191, 435195, 40679, '<td valign="top">yes. but not as ghosts, more as a new life and being a new person. nice long exposure. I like shooting at cemetaries, but not at night ;)</td>', 'yes. but not as ghosts, more as a new life and being a new person. nice long exposure. I like shooting at cemetaries, but not at night ;)', '2006-12-07 16:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
