(3097218, 434163, 40679, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m totally bumping up your entry, this is beautiful. the colortones are awesome, the diagonal lines are sweet, and the abstractness of the image is fantastic. added to faves.</td>', 'OK, I''m totally bumping up your entry, this is beautiful. the colortones are awesome, the diagonal lines are sweet, and the abstractness of the image is fantastic. added to faves.', '2006-12-07 16:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097225, 435136, 40679, '<td valign="top">I''m coming back to this one again and again. I think I can see why you choose this photo for the challenge, but I bet a lot of voters don''t. great lighting and use of colors.</td>', 'I''m coming back to this one again and again. I think I can see why you choose this photo for the challenge, but I bet a lot of voters don''t. great lighting and use of colors.', '2006-12-07 16:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097227, 432985, 40679, '<td valign="top">oe wow. I''m gonna check your comments after the challenge to see what this is and what happened. very interesting. bumping up!</td>', 'oe wow. I''m gonna check your comments after the challenge to see what this is and what happened. very interesting. bumping up!', '2006-12-07 16:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097230, 434039, 40679, '<td valign="top">hehehe there always is a woody in a challenge ;) nice humouristic shot ;)</td>', 'hehehe there always is a woody in a challenge ;) nice humouristic shot ;)', '2006-12-07 16:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097239, 435009, 29490, '<td valign="top">You make it all look so clinical! :)  Great composition, this is a dandy.  Score:  2<br/> <br/>Noooo, I''m kidding about the score.  8! :)</td>', 'You make it all look so clinical! :)  Great composition, this is a dandy.  Score:  2 Noooo, I''m kidding about the score.  8! :)', '2006-12-07 16:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097263, 435209, 40679, '<td valign="top">haha, the title is so funny, it just doesn''t fit the image ;)<br/>not too fond about the iamge noise.</td>', 'haha, the title is so funny, it just doesn''t fit the image ;)not too fond about the iamge noise.', '2006-12-07 16:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097299, 435000, 32644, '<td valign="top">Gross! This looks like a ''real'' cat.</td>', 'Gross! This looks like a ''real'' cat.', '2006-12-07 16:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097325, 435209, 55908, '<td valign="top">The chair and hanging feet speak volumes and make this a very impactful image. Using white shows against the cold hard brick background really work well and hit viewers between the eyes with the message. On the technical side, I can''t decide if I like the grungy vertical lines spanning through the image or not. On one hand, they really add to the harsh mood, on the other, it''s a bit distracting. Up to the viewer I guess. While I''m normally a fan of a humorous title, I don''t think it plays in favor of the image here. I don''t vote according to titles, but "how''s it hanging?" seems a little tactless for the image''s morbid mood. Overall, very well done. 8o)</td>', 'The chair and hanging feet speak volumes and make this a very impactful image. Using white shows against the cold hard brick background really work well and hit viewers between the eyes with the message. On the technical side, I can''t decide if I like the grungy vertical lines spanning through the image or not. On one hand, they really add to the harsh mood, on the other, it''s a bit distracting. Up to the viewer I guess. While I''m normally a fan of a humorous title, I don''t think it plays in favor of the image here. I don''t vote according to titles, but "how''s it hanging?" seems a little tactless for the image''s morbid mood. Overall, very well done. 8o)', '2006-12-07 16:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097330, 434493, 40679, '<td valign="top">this is just plain good! Love the reflection in the knife, and the cold expression on their faces. brilliant!<br/> <br/>added to faves :D</td>', 'this is just plain good! Love the reflection in the knife, and the cold expression on their faces. brilliant! added to faves :D', '2006-12-07 16:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097334, 434797, 40679, '<td valign="top">that thing in his hands (can''t find the word now) looks sooo familiar ;) don''t you love it as a prop?<br/> <br/>might''ve been better with only seeing the eyes, instead of the whole face.</td>', 'that thing in his hands (can''t find the word now) looks sooo familiar ;) don''t you love it as a prop? might''ve been better with only seeing the eyes, instead of the whole face.', '2006-12-07 16:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097337, 434684, 40679, '<td valign="top">beautiful detail, DoF and bokeh, crisp sharpness, nice compo. nothing wrong with this photo of yours!</td>', 'beautiful detail, DoF and bokeh, crisp sharpness, nice compo. nothing wrong with this photo of yours!', '2006-12-07 16:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097343, 434213, 40679, '<td valign="top">this is IR again right? nice colors. the lensflare looks weird in this setting, but it also adds some mystery. nice job.</td>', 'this is IR again right? nice colors. the lensflare looks weird in this setting, but it also adds some mystery. nice job.', '2006-12-07 16:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
