(3097415, 435194, 40679, '<td valign="top">I think this is the only metal-ly photo in the challenge. I think you did a great job. love the pose and the location. not too fond about the lights at the background.</td>', 'I think this is the only metal-ly photo in the challenge. I think you did a great job. love the pose and the location. not too fond about the lights at the background.', '2006-12-07 16:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
