(3097420, 434241, 55908, '<td valign="top">Great idea; reminds me of a movie still. Unfortunately, there are a lot of technical distractions in this image that keep me from really connecting with it as a viewer. The yellow/greenish color cast is a big one but that can normally be fixed by playing with your white balance while shooting. I''d love to see a bit more detail in the shadows as well. For the sake of the challenge, it might have been stronger to bring the menacing silhouette slightly closer to the subject and perhaps have the subject looking worried or anxiously over her shoulder instead of directly at the camera. To me, she draws away from the main idea. Cool idea though!</td>', 'Great idea; reminds me of a movie still. Unfortunately, there are a lot of technical distractions in this image that keep me from really connecting with it as a viewer. The yellow/greenish color cast is a big one but that can normally be fixed by playing with your white balance while shooting. I''d love to see a bit more detail in the shadows as well. For the sake of the challenge, it might have been stronger to bring the menacing silhouette slightly closer to the subject and perhaps have the subject looking worried or anxiously over her shoulder instead of directly at the camera. To me, she draws away from the main idea. Cool idea though!', '2006-12-07 16:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097424, 435000, 69627, '<td valign="top">This guy who took the photo is not very good</td>', 'This guy who took the photo is not very good', '2006-12-07 16:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097429, 435058, 55908, '<td valign="top">Wonderful mood this image establishes! The light behind the tree really accentuates the spooky branches and the looming fog really pulls everything together. I''d love to see a larger version of this image! The background seems to tell a whole other story. B&amp;W was definitely the way to go here! Very well composed and controlled. 8o)</td>', 'Wonderful mood this image establishes! The light behind the tree really accentuates the spooky branches and the looming fog really pulls everything together. I''d love to see a larger version of this image! The background seems to tell a whole other story. B&W was definitely the way to go here! Very well composed and controlled. 8o)', '2006-12-07 16:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
