(3097863, 434197, 55908, '<td valign="top">This is a very intriguing image, but I''m not totally sure what I''m supposed to be looking at. Interesting nonetheless. I see fur, it''s some sort of animal. Technically it''s very well done! I guess the subject is just sort of cryptic to me. 6.</td>', 'This is a very intriguing image, but I''m not totally sure what I''m supposed to be looking at. Interesting nonetheless. I see fur, it''s some sort of animal. Technically it''s very well done! I guess the subject is just sort of cryptic to me. 6.', '2006-12-07 19:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097884, 435237, 55908, '<td valign="top">Very cool! A lot like a movie poster! Breaking the ''fourth wall'' between subject and viewer actually works well here. She has a very haunted look in her eye and the ominous scull floating behind is lit perfectly! Very well composed and captured image! 8o)</td>', 'Very cool! A lot like a movie poster! Breaking the ''fourth wall'' between subject and viewer actually works well here. She has a very haunted look in her eye and the ominous scull floating behind is lit perfectly! Very well composed and captured image! 8o)', '2006-12-07 19:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097909, 433594, 55908, '<td valign="top">Really creative! The lighting seems very precise and like it took a lot of forethought. This is well composed and well captured! Shadows and highlights are great! Rhythm worked well here to really emphasis the main subject, which is actually not there! One of my favorites so far! Well done! 8o)</td>', 'Really creative! The lighting seems very precise and like it took a lot of forethought. This is well composed and well captured! Shadows and highlights are great! Rhythm worked well here to really emphasis the main subject, which is actually not there! One of my favorites so far! Well done! 8o)', '2006-12-07 19:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097932, 434716, 55908, '<td valign="top">This is a strangely affective image! I wouldn''t think a torn up old car could evoke as much emotive response as this does. You''ve done an excellent job with the image both compositionally and technically in my opinion! 8o)</td>', 'This is a strangely affective image! I wouldn''t think a torn up old car could evoke as much emotive response as this does. You''ve done an excellent job with the image both compositionally and technically in my opinion! 8o)', '2006-12-07 19:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097955, 435055, 55908, '<td valign="top">It certainly looks dead! It''s amazing to see shots like these that one would never see with the naked eye. Doesn''t quite evoke a powerful mood for me, but technically, this image is great! 7. 8o)</td>', 'It certainly looks dead! It''s amazing to see shots like these that one would never see with the naked eye. Doesn''t quite evoke a powerful mood for me, but technically, this image is great! 7. 8o)', '2006-12-07 19:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097973, 434252, 55908, '<td valign="top">The first thing I really like about this image is the dreamy glow surrounding the subject! Great choice of colors too! Overall, this is a very strong image that evokes an affective mood! I''m still deciding whether or not the green grass works for me and if there were a more interesting angle that could have been used, but I still give it a 8. Well done! 8o)</td>', 'The first thing I really like about this image is the dreamy glow surrounding the subject! Great choice of colors too! Overall, this is a very strong image that evokes an affective mood! I''m still deciding whether or not the green grass works for me and if there were a more interesting angle that could have been used, but I still give it a 8. Well done! 8o)', '2006-12-07 19:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097977, 434896, 55908, '<td valign="top">Wow the sharpness of this image is incredible! Needless to say, you nailed it technically and conceptually. Composition is quite appealing too! Very well done! I can see this doing quite well! 8o)</td>', 'Wow the sharpness of this image is incredible! Needless to say, you nailed it technically and conceptually. Composition is quite appealing too! Very well done! I can see this doing quite well! 8o)', '2006-12-07 19:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097980, 434945, 44607, '<td valign="top">!!!!!a fantastic photo !great colors and composition.....</td>', '!!!!!a fantastic photo !great colors and composition.....', '2006-12-07 19:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097982, 434057, 55908, '<td valign="top">This is quite disturbing and works well for the challenge. The stark colors are a great touch as well! I can''t quite put my finger on it, but something keeps me, the viewer, from really connecting with this image though. Very well done though! 8o)</td>', 'This is quite disturbing and works well for the challenge. The stark colors are a great touch as well! I can''t quite put my finger on it, but something keeps me, the viewer, from really connecting with this image though. Very well done though! 8o)', '2006-12-07 19:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097987, 435233, 55908, '<td valign="top">Ahh that shadow is brilliant! I would almost say that shadow is your picture right there, imo! The two white roses, miniture scare crow, and the shadow of the cross burned in the patch of snow. That says it all to me, but that''s just my opinion. As emotive as this image is, I find the actual written words a little unneccessary and slightly distracting, technically speaking of course. Well done though!</td>', 'Ahh that shadow is brilliant! I would almost say that shadow is your picture right there, imo! The two white roses, miniture scare crow, and the shadow of the cross burned in the patch of snow. That says it all to me, but that''s just my opinion. As emotive as this image is, I find the actual written words a little unneccessary and slightly distracting, technically speaking of course. Well done though!', '2006-12-07 19:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097989, 434341, 61705, '<td valign="top">Hannibal Lecter maybe?? ;)</td>', 'Hannibal Lecter maybe?? ;)', '2006-12-07 19:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097992, 433859, 55908, '<td valign="top">The colors are certainly compelling as are the horns, but they almost blend in a bit too much. The skull is the main subject and that works well. But to me, the lighting if fairly flat and doesn''t offer much as far as setting the mood. Still a compelling shot though!</td>', 'The colors are certainly compelling as are the horns, but they almost blend in a bit too much. The skull is the main subject and that works well. But to me, the lighting if fairly flat and doesn''t offer much as far as setting the mood. Still a compelling shot though!', '2006-12-07 19:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097999, 434237, 55908, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, but I think there are too many background distractions that don''t add anything to the subject, which is really interesting and unique. The Old Graves are really what I want to see with the aged moss and dead leaves covering them. A tighter crop would make this a much stronger image IMO.</td>', 'I like the idea here, but I think there are too many background distractions that don''t add anything to the subject, which is really interesting and unique. The Old Graves are really what I want to see with the aged moss and dead leaves covering them. A tighter crop would make this a much stronger image IMO.', '2006-12-07 19:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3098011, 435239, 55908, '<td valign="top">I love how this is so raw and grungy looking! The image has a definite feel that works well for this challenge. I like how the focus is selective and just at the belt. It probably could have even used an even shallower dof. The body on the side of the image is very distracting to me however and pulls my eye off the subject and out of the picture. I think all that''s needed really is part of the arm with the belt around it, the spoon, lighter and syringe, and the subtle blood stains and bruises on the arm. Other than that, this is one of my favorites. Well done! 8o)</td>', 'I love how this is so raw and grungy looking! The image has a definite feel that works well for this challenge. I like how the focus is selective and just at the belt. It probably could have even used an even shallower dof. The body on the side of the image is very distracting to me however and pulls my eye off the subject and out of the picture. I think all that''s needed really is part of the arm with the belt around it, the spoon, lighter and syringe, and the subtle blood stains and bruises on the arm. Other than that, this is one of my favorites. Well done! 8o)', '2006-12-07 19:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
