(3098624, 434339, 61818, '<td valign="top">These people are old, not dead.  Pretty insulting to ''explore death'' by submitting a shot of some old people.  Then again maybe they are dead.  They aren''t moving after all.</td>', 'These people are old, not dead.  Pretty insulting to ''explore death'' by submitting a shot of some old people.  Then again maybe they are dead.  They aren''t moving after all.', '2006-12-07 23:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3098636, 435000, 61818, '<td valign="top">What prevented you from getting down on your belly and shooting something drastic and dramatic?  A shot into the face with the blood spilling into the foreground for instance.  I don''t know wher eyou live, but in 33 years I''ve not once seen a dead cat laying on the street like this.  So this is a) something unusual, b) something that anyone with a functioning eye can see meets the challenge and c) could make for a shocking, dramatic photo.  Unfortunately what''s come of it is someone walking up, pointing the camera down, and taking a snapshot.  If you thought this was worth taking a picture of, you should consider what it is about this that makes it worthy and then do your best to capture that and present it to the voters/viewers.<br/> <br/>Sorry for preaching.  There''s a ton of garbage entries in this challenge so seeing something that had so much promise given the tourist treatment just got me yapping.  <br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'What prevented you from getting down on your belly and shooting something drastic and dramatic?  A shot into the face with the blood spilling into the foreground for instance.  I don''t know wher eyou live, but in 33 years I''ve not once seen a dead cat laying on the street like this.  So this is a) something unusual, b) something that anyone with a functioning eye can see meets the challenge and c) could make for a shocking, dramatic photo.  Unfortunately what''s come of it is someone walking up, pointing the camera down, and taking a snapshot.  If you thought this was worth taking a picture of, you should consider what it is about this that makes it worthy and then do your best to capture that and present it to the voters/viewers. Sorry for preaching.  There''s a ton of garbage entries in this challenge so seeing something that had so much promise given the tourist treatment just got me yapping.   Good luck.', '2006-12-07 23:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3098644, 435209, 61818, '<td valign="top">Heheheh.  This is pretty good actually and the title gives it a light hearted spin.  Only suggestion would be possibly shooting from a bit of a lower angle to reinforce the ''hanging'' aspect and maybe lighten the shot a tad.  The shot is so dark it took me a second to see the gap between feet and chair.</td>', 'Heheheh.  This is pretty good actually and the title gives it a light hearted spin.  Only suggestion would be possibly shooting from a bit of a lower angle to reinforce the ''hanging'' aspect and maybe lighten the shot a tad.  The shot is so dark it took me a second to see the gap between feet and chair.', '2006-12-07 23:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
