(3099255, 434122, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...they asked for validation of my photo. Can you guess which one? I''m giving you a score almost double what mine is currently running at. My hope is fading but my judgement is not failing - I''m not stingy with points like some people here. It''s a top-notch photo you have. 10</td>', 'Hmmm...they asked for validation of my photo. Can you guess which one? I''m giving you a score almost double what mine is currently running at. My hope is fading but my judgement is not failing - I''m not stingy with points like some people here. It''s a top-notch photo you have. 10', '2006-12-08 07:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
