(3099264, 434512, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s such a beautiful photo...if it were a realistic skull I would have given it a 10. 9</td>', 'It''s such a beautiful photo...if it were a realistic skull I would have given it a 10. 9', '2006-12-08 07:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
