(3099616, 435081, 40679, '<td valign="top">compositional this is great, my eyes go from left to right. I do think the photo is a bit too dark, somehow I think it wou;d be better if the rising girl got the same lighting as the girl laying down. (I know these are the same girls ;-))</td>', 'compositional this is great, my eyes go from left to right. I do think the photo is a bit too dark, somehow I think it wou;d be better if the rising girl got the same lighting as the girl laying down. (I know these are the same girls ;-))', '2006-12-08 11:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099620, 434708, 40679, '<td valign="top">nice simple entry, I think I''d make it even more simple and get rid of the stems and flowers at the top and bottom, so only the word and the rose.</td>', 'nice simple entry, I think I''d make it even more simple and get rid of the stems and flowers at the top and bottom, so only the word and the rose.', '2006-12-08 11:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099622, 435117, 40679, '<td valign="top">the colors are nice here, the green with the yellow and blue. interesting compo.</td>', 'the colors are nice here, the green with the yellow and blue. interesting compo.', '2006-12-08 11:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099625, 434392, 40679, '<td valign="top">aaw too bad of the ribbon at the right, would like to see it in whole. love the colors and simplicity.</td>', 'aaw too bad of the ribbon at the right, would like to see it in whole. love the colors and simplicity.', '2006-12-08 11:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099629, 434602, 40679, '<td valign="top">lovely lighting and composition here. I might like a bit more light on the flower itself.</td>', 'lovely lighting and composition here. I might like a bit more light on the flower itself.', '2006-12-08 11:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
