(3099718, 435032, 40679, '<td valign="top">I know the word!! ;)<br/> <br/>humouristic idea, but a bit of a boring execution (pun intended!) I wouldn''t know how to improve this one actually, maybe create the hangman with sticks and rope?</td>', 'I know the word!! ;) humouristic idea, but a bit of a boring execution (pun intended!) I wouldn''t know how to improve this one actually, maybe create the hangman with sticks and rope?', '2006-12-08 11:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099720, 434159, 40679, '<td valign="top">flowers right in the bin... <br/> <br/>the colors are a bit too saturated for my taste, maybe b/w would do this image better, but not sure if it''s more interesting like that.</td>', 'flowers right in the bin...  the colors are a bit too saturated for my taste, maybe b/w would do this image better, but not sure if it''s more interesting like that.', '2006-12-08 11:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099729, 434006, 40679, '<td valign="top">looks like your entry isn''t very sharp, or a bit too much PP? I can''t really tell. might be nice if the right track of the road was on the photo in whole.</td>', 'looks like your entry isn''t very sharp, or a bit too much PP? I can''t really tell. might be nice if the right track of the road was on the photo in whole.', '2006-12-08 11:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099737, 434989, 40679, '<td valign="top">this is a bit too colorful for death :P<br/> <br/>the idea with the fire-image is nice, but a bit obvious because of the shadow. you might wanna use not so much chocolate in front of it, it makes the photo a bit too messy.</td>', 'this is a bit too colorful for death :P the idea with the fire-image is nice, but a bit obvious because of the shadow. you might wanna use not so much chocolate in front of it, it makes the photo a bit too messy.', '2006-12-08 11:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099743, 434237, 40679, '<td valign="top">maybe use a different PoV (from the ground forwards) to create a bit more interesting DoF. the colors are a bit flat and the subject isn''t very interesting IMO.</td>', 'maybe use a different PoV (from the ground forwards) to create a bit more interesting DoF. the colors are a bit flat and the subject isn''t very interesting IMO.', '2006-12-08 11:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099844, 433573, 67999, '<td valign="top">i like this one good use of a filter for color, i dont know how much i care for the dual fangs but other then that i like the impact of the diagonal lines it adds to the mood which i think is fury...</td>', 'i like this one good use of a filter for color, i dont know how much i care for the dual fangs but other then that i like the impact of the diagonal lines it adds to the mood which i think is fury...', '2006-12-08 12:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099848, 435182, 67999, '<td valign="top">what is that white webbing type stuff? a cobweb?</td>', 'what is that white webbing type stuff? a cobweb?', '2006-12-08 12:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099860, 435323, 55908, '<td valign="top">This says death alright! Can''t say much for the ultra contrasty processing, personally. I think it loses a lot photography''s inherent "feeling" when it becomes an illustratrative image.</td>', 'This says death alright! Can''t say much for the ultra contrasty processing, personally. I think it loses a lot photography''s inherent "feeling" when it becomes an illustratrative image.', '2006-12-08 12:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099867, 433689, 55908, '<td valign="top">This is my second time hitting this image and it''s just as impactful the second time! The branches are beautifully chaotic and I like to look at this as a visual representation of life! There is so much to read into here for such a simple image. It helps that it''s impeccably processed too. I really hope this is doing well despite it''s non-literal interpretation of the challenge. 9 from me! 8o)</td>', 'This is my second time hitting this image and it''s just as impactful the second time! The branches are beautifully chaotic and I like to look at this as a visual representation of life! There is so much to read into here for such a simple image. It helps that it''s impeccably processed too. I really hope this is doing well despite it''s non-literal interpretation of the challenge. 9 from me! 8o)', '2006-12-08 12:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099874, 433431, 55908, '<td valign="top">The composition is very interesting and I really like how the sillohettes form a natural frame for the subject. It''s very geomtric and simple/clean and technically works quite well. I wish there were a bit more light on the steeple and cross, it feels slightly flat and under-exposed. I think that would have also kicked up the mood and impact of the image a notch. Well done! 8o)</td>', 'The composition is very interesting and I really like how the sillohettes form a natural frame for the subject. It''s very geomtric and simple/clean and technically works quite well. I wish there were a bit more light on the steeple and cross, it feels slightly flat and under-exposed. I think that would have also kicked up the mood and impact of the image a notch. Well done! 8o)', '2006-12-08 13:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099883, 435310, 55908, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, very Shakespearian! I like the arms coming out of darkness and clenching the skull. I think this represents the challenge well and you''ve captured it well.</td>', 'Great lighting, very Shakespearian! I like the arms coming out of darkness and clenching the skull. I think this represents the challenge well and you''ve captured it well.', '2006-12-08 13:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099888, 435315, 55908, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative and nicely captured. I must admit, at first glance, the soft focus was a bit of a turn-off, but once I noticed the ''spirit'' rising from the body, it worked. It added to the dreaminess and mysticism of the image. Tough shot to make with basic editing rules but I think you''ve faired quite well! 8o)</td>', 'Very imaginative and nicely captured. I must admit, at first glance, the soft focus was a bit of a turn-off, but once I noticed the ''spirit'' rising from the body, it worked. It added to the dreaminess and mysticism of the image. Tough shot to make with basic editing rules but I think you''ve faired quite well! 8o)', '2006-12-08 13:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099895, 435231, 55908, '<td valign="top">Well done with the cold blue cast, really sets the tone. As hard as it is to really connect with a foot, i find this images curiously alluring. Just watch out for those blown out highlights int he background, they''re kind of distracting.</td>', 'Well done with the cold blue cast, really sets the tone. As hard as it is to really connect with a foot, i find this images curiously alluring. Just watch out for those blown out highlights int he background, they''re kind of distracting.', '2006-12-08 13:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099903, 434493, 59442, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge!</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge!', '2006-12-08 13:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099904, 435156, 55908, '<td valign="top">Facinating group of trees! Their leaning really makes the photo for me. To be perfectly honest, it''s hard for me as a viewer to really connect with dead trees, but the leaning really keep my attention. Maybe better in black and white to really drive the point home for this challenge though?</td>', 'Facinating group of trees! Their leaning really makes the photo for me. To be perfectly honest, it''s hard for me as a viewer to really connect with dead trees, but the leaning really keep my attention. Maybe better in black and white to really drive the point home for this challenge though?', '2006-12-08 13:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099905, 434731, 59442, '<td valign="top">Super image!</td>', 'Super image!', '2006-12-08 13:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099913, 435181, 53018, '<td valign="top">HOW TRUE !!!</td>', 'HOW TRUE !!!', '2006-12-08 13:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099916, 434231, 55908, '<td valign="top">This is nicely done! The contrast between the dead and dying works well, and then the green and thriving just behind really accentuates the rotten banana. I like this a lot! It is simple and clean and meets the challenge well without being too shrill. Well done! 8o)</td>', 'This is nicely done! The contrast between the dead and dying works well, and then the green and thriving just behind really accentuates the rotten banana. I like this a lot! It is simple and clean and meets the challenge well without being too shrill. Well done! 8o)', '2006-12-08 13:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
