(3100005, 435161, 55908, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful and I never thought a shell could evoke such emotive impact! You''ve done and astounding job with this image and I think it''s perfectly fitting for the challenge. It is so refreshing to see photos of the subtlies of life that most would never notice and have it captured so beautifully! Fantastic job! My first 10 for this challene. 8o)</td>', 'This is really beautiful and I never thought a shell could evoke such emotive impact! You''ve done and astounding job with this image and I think it''s perfectly fitting for the challenge. It is so refreshing to see photos of the subtlies of life that most would never notice and have it captured so beautifully! Fantastic job! My first 10 for this challene. 8o)', '2006-12-08 13:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
