(3101391, 434540, 32913, '<td valign="top">it has a powwerfull effect on me, it doesnt mean i like it, but it delivers the message.</td>', 'it has a powwerfull effect on me, it doesnt mean i like it, but it delivers the message.', '2006-12-08 23:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101404, 434882, 14476, '<td valign="top">Well thought out piece.  "if it was mine" I''d probably crop out a lot of the background adding more emphasis on the leaves.  But it''s not, it''s yours, and I really like the idea behind this very nice image.</td>', 'Well thought out piece.  "if it was mine" I''d probably crop out a lot of the background adding more emphasis on the leaves.  But it''s not, it''s yours, and I really like the idea behind this very nice image.', '2006-12-08 23:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101414, 435231, 32913, '<td valign="top">Yes, it has been seen around but you manage to perform well.</td>', 'Yes, it has been seen around but you manage to perform well.', '2006-12-08 23:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101422, 435320, 32913, '<td valign="top">From all the shots ive seen of dead flowers this one is the best.</td>', 'From all the shots ive seen of dead flowers this one is the best.', '2006-12-09 00:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101430, 433726, 32913, '<td valign="top">One of the best so far.</td>', 'One of the best so far.', '2006-12-09 00:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101432, 435178, 32913, '<td valign="top">Fuuny</td>', 'Fuuny', '2006-12-09 00:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101441, 435189, 32913, '<td valign="top">Strange but misterious, it has the dead feeling to it</td>', 'Strange but misterious, it has the dead feeling to it', '2006-12-09 00:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101454, 434339, 32913, '<td valign="top">Santa in the back, this is a low kick in the b..., Well done.</td>', 'Santa in the back, this is a low kick in the b..., Well done.', '2006-12-09 00:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101458, 434882, 32913, '<td valign="top">It would have been perfect if ths had a plain white background, still I think is a veri nice graphical idea. At least someone did something different with leafs.</td>', 'It would have been perfect if ths had a plain white background, still I think is a veri nice graphical idea. At least someone did something different with leafs.', '2006-12-09 00:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101472, 434122, 32913, '<td valign="top">good excecution.</td>', 'good excecution.', '2006-12-09 00:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101480, 434512, 32913, '<td valign="top">my kind of shot, how did you find that weird skeleton?</td>', 'my kind of shot, how did you find that weird skeleton?', '2006-12-09 00:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101485, 435239, 32913, '<td valign="top">strong , very well done</td>', 'strong , very well done', '2006-12-09 00:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101662, 435009, 53316, '<td valign="top">Was this inspired by the Soul Calibur 3 character <a href="//images.google.com/images?hl=en&amp;q=zasalamel" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Zasalamel</a>?  I wouldn''t have thought it at first except for your title.  Let me know! :)  Anyway, I''m back to bump up a few scores and I can''t bump yours anymore so yeah. :-) I think this is just great.. so bold.. and it''s staged obviously, but somehow (usually I don''t like obviously staged shots) it just realy seems to work. I think with the lighting being so bold it sort of just all fits.  Background is awesome as well as expression of the model. Great shot.</td>', 'Was this inspired by the Soul Calibur 3 character Zasalamel?  I wouldn''t have thought it at first except for your title.  Let me know! :)  Anyway, I''m back to bump up a few scores and I can''t bump yours anymore so yeah. :-) I think this is just great.. so bold.. and it''s staged obviously, but somehow (usually I don''t like obviously staged shots) it just realy seems to work. I think with the lighting being so bold it sort of just all fits.  Background is awesome as well as expression of the model. Great shot.', '2006-12-09 02:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101675, 435116, 53316, '<td valign="top">I did not give this a high score for a couple reasons: The background up top is distracting, and the animal sort of blends into the white snow. Tones seem pretty flat to me. Basically with the subject matter being what it is, it needs a good artistic treatment to be visually appealing as a photo and I do not find that here.. one thing I do think you had right was that the selective desaturation definitly adds to the gross impact of the subject, and if that is what you were going for then I think you were on the right track with it.</td>', 'I did not give this a high score for a couple reasons: The background up top is distracting, and the animal sort of blends into the white snow. Tones seem pretty flat to me. Basically with the subject matter being what it is, it needs a good artistic treatment to be visually appealing as a photo and I do not find that here.. one thing I do think you had right was that the selective desaturation definitly adds to the gross impact of the subject, and if that is what you were going for then I think you were on the right track with it.', '2006-12-09 02:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101680, 434505, 53316, '<td valign="top">You know... as much as it hurts me to look at this image (I had pet mice) I am gonna bump your score up some because I think that among the dead animal pictures this is one of the ones that got the artistic aspect down a little better. Things are in focus, lighting seems good, composition is decent, colors are good.</td>', 'You know... as much as it hurts me to look at this image (I had pet mice) I am gonna bump your score up some because I think that among the dead animal pictures this is one of the ones that got the artistic aspect down a little better. Things are in focus, lighting seems good, composition is decent, colors are good.', '2006-12-09 02:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101686, 434671, 53316, '<td valign="top">I didn''t give this a good score at first.. I am bumping you up. Still not giving you a wonderful score but I do want to recognize the fact that this subject matter has been presented in a decently artistic way.</td>', 'I didn''t give this a good score at first.. I am bumping you up. Still not giving you a wonderful score but I do want to recognize the fact that this subject matter has been presented in a decently artistic way.', '2006-12-09 02:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101700, 434542, 53316, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this will ribbon.  It is wonderfully amazingly beautiful... the processing is magical. Only thing that keeps it from being a perfect image to me (but didn''t keep it from a perfect score) is the diagonal line at the bottom left... sort of breaks up the background a little.  The soft effect at the edges and a dramatic desaturation like this is great to see in a basic editing challenge.</td>', 'I wonder if this will ribbon.  It is wonderfully amazingly beautiful... the processing is magical. Only thing that keeps it from being a perfect image to me (but didn''t keep it from a perfect score) is the diagonal line at the bottom left... sort of breaks up the background a little.  The soft effect at the edges and a dramatic desaturation like this is great to see in a basic editing challenge.', '2006-12-09 02:31:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3101701, 435295, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great concept!</td>', 'Great concept!', '2006-12-09 02:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101706, 435264, 52130, '<td valign="top">...that would be more like hell 0.0<br/>great work!</td>', '...that would be more like hell 0.0great work!', '2006-12-09 02:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101729, 434229, 36397, '<td valign="top">What an expression! Wonderfull. It looks like a 100% crop with some subtle sharpening and increased saturation of colors. Because of this the bird looses a bit of it''s natural beauty but it remains a great shot.</td>', 'What an expression! Wonderfull. It looks like a 100% crop with some subtle sharpening and increased saturation of colors. Because of this the bird looses a bit of it''s natural beauty but it remains a great shot.', '2006-12-09 03:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101780, 434505, 47842, '<td valign="top">its disgusting! but u deserve good points for that...:)</td>', 'its disgusting! but u deserve good points for that...:)', '2006-12-09 05:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101796, 433726, 61191, '<td valign="top">Spooky! ... Cool shot.</td>', 'Spooky! ... Cool shot.', '2006-12-09 06:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101798, 434493, 61191, '<td valign="top">Great idea, love the atmoshpere.</td>', 'Great idea, love the atmoshpere.', '2006-12-09 06:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101800, 433629, 61191, '<td valign="top">Like the graininess here. The high contrast works well.</td>', 'Like the graininess here. The high contrast works well.', '2006-12-09 07:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101808, 434877, 56167, '<td valign="top">would have like to have seen it a bit sharper focus but love the idea that death means nothing left, good luck</td>', 'would have like to have seen it a bit sharper focus but love the idea that death means nothing left, good luck', '2006-12-09 07:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101811, 434947, 56167, '<td valign="top">I hope no animals were hurt during this photo "shooting"  :-))</td>', 'I hope no animals were hurt during this photo "shooting"  :-))', '2006-12-09 07:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101813, 434997, 56167, '<td valign="top">title suits, you can see it once was a beautiful flower, but the good focus shows how life has been sucked out of it. well done</td>', 'title suits, you can see it once was a beautiful flower, but the good focus shows how life has been sucked out of it. well done', '2006-12-09 07:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
