(3102524, 434731, 3102, '<td valign="top">There are quite a few attempts at the "ghost" effect in this challenge, but I think you did an outstanding job of it.  I like the interaction here.</td>', 'There are quite a few attempts at the "ghost" effect in this challenge, but I think you did an outstanding job of it.  I like the interaction here.', '2006-12-09 15:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3102531, 434057, 19708, '<td valign="top">IF it can catch us - I''m immortal. ;)<br/>Good take on this challenge (gotta'' look more dead though)<br/>j/k</td>', 'IF it can catch us - I''m immortal. ;)Good take on this challenge (gotta'' look more dead though)j/k', '2006-12-09 15:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3102550, 435264, 63360, '<td valign="top">Creative idea.</td>', 'Creative idea.', '2006-12-09 15:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3102552, 433247, 63360, '<td valign="top">The post-processing effectively sets the mood.  Nice work.</td>', 'The post-processing effectively sets the mood.  Nice work.', '2006-12-09 15:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3102554, 434006, 63360, '<td valign="top">Funny title; a bit more contrast would improve the details in the background.</td>', 'Funny title; a bit more contrast would improve the details in the background.', '2006-12-09 15:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3102556, 434882, 63360, '<td valign="top">I like the idea; a different background (on soil, for example) would be better.</td>', 'I like the idea; a different background (on soil, for example) would be better.', '2006-12-09 15:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3102557, 434384, 63360, '<td valign="top">I like the pop of color here.</td>', 'I like the pop of color here.', '2006-12-09 16:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3102561, 432985, 63360, '<td valign="top">I like the way the flames move throughout the entire photo.  Nice work.</td>', 'I like the way the flames move throughout the entire photo.  Nice work.', '2006-12-09 16:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3102564, 435233, 63360, '<td valign="top">The shadow of the cross on the snow produces a nice effect and I like the level of saturation here.  (I don''t understand why people want to "memorialize" the site where a loved one was killed.)</td>', 'The shadow of the cross on the snow produces a nice effect and I like the level of saturation here.  (I don''t understand why people want to "memorialize" the site where a loved one was killed.)', '2006-12-09 16:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3102567, 434423, 63360, '<td valign="top">Nice effect.</td>', 'Nice effect.', '2006-12-09 16:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3102568, 435009, 19708, '<td valign="top">Oohhhhh - shorter &amp; darker hair incognito hey?<br/>I''m not sure I''ll ever wanna'' play a game with you.<br/>Perfect shot for this challenge!</td>', 'Oohhhhh - shorter & darker hair incognito hey?I''m not sure I''ll ever wanna'' play a game with you.Perfect shot for this challenge!', '2006-12-09 16:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3102570, 433589, 63360, '<td valign="top">Idea is fine; needs to be in better focus.  Maybe a more interesting composition would be to have placed your model further in the background with more of the undecorated tombstones in view.</td>', 'Idea is fine; needs to be in better focus.  Maybe a more interesting composition would be to have placed your model further in the background with more of the undecorated tombstones in view.', '2006-12-09 16:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
