(3103488, 435000, 53316, '<td valign="top">I did not give this a high score and I want to explain why.  I find that the background is not good - the lines just cut through visually what I want to focus on. The image quality seems a bit pixelated and the subject does not seem in focus as much as I feel it should be.  Basically with the subject matter being what it is, it needs a good artistic treatment to be visually appealing as a photo and I do not find that here.</td>', 'I did not give this a high score and I want to explain why.  I find that the background is not good - the lines just cut through visually what I want to focus on. The image quality seems a bit pixelated and the subject does not seem in focus as much as I feel it should be.  Basically with the subject matter being what it is, it needs a good artistic treatment to be visually appealing as a photo and I do not find that here.', '2006-12-10 01:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103489, 435209, 53316, '<td valign="top">I think photos depicting suicide are fine in a death challenge but I personally would prefer it not seemingly treated lightly (with a title that seems as though it makes light of suicide).  I am sorry if you did not mean it this way - I am certainly not accusing you of trying to treat the subject lightly at all. I do not know your motivations and don''t pretend to know. I am just telling you how it seems to me.</td>', 'I think photos depicting suicide are fine in a death challenge but I personally would prefer it not seemingly treated lightly (with a title that seems as though it makes light of suicide).  I am sorry if you did not mean it this way - I am certainly not accusing you of trying to treat the subject lightly at all. I do not know your motivations and don''t pretend to know. I am just telling you how it seems to me.', '2006-12-10 01:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103491, 432962, 53316, '<td valign="top">I did not give this a high score because of multiple things. I think that the background is distracting. The composition does not draw my eye towards the subject.  The way that the background and the fur look makes the image seem a bit pixelated, so  a different choice of background would have helped for that reason as well. Basically with the subject matter being what it is, it needs a good artistic treatment to be visually appealing as a photo.<br/> <br/>edit: I want to add that when I first commented on this picture I assumed it to be something you found and did not want to "rearrange" for photography purposes.  So I said about different choice of background but I should also have added a couple other ideas. one might be to take a picture much closer, assuming you can get good macro shots out of your camera. so that there is less background - maybe even only a part of the mouse/rat as well.  Another thing you could have done is put your camera on the ground and shot towards the animal.  Depending on what surrounded you, you might have been ab le to get a nice, more solid background, maybe even some bokeh (see previous bokeh challenges).</td>', 'I did not give this a high score because of multiple things. I think that the background is distracting. The composition does not draw my eye towards the subject.  The way that the background and the fur look makes the image seem a bit pixelated, so  a different choice of background would have helped for that reason as well. Basically with the subject matter being what it is, it needs a good artistic treatment to be visually appealing as a photo. edit: I want to add that when I first commented on this picture I assumed it to be something you found and did not want to "rearrange" for photography purposes.  So I said about different choice of background but I should also have added a couple other ideas. one might be to take a picture much closer, assuming you can get good macro shots out of your camera. so that there is less background - maybe even only a part of the mouse/rat as well.  Another thing you could have done is put your camera on the ground and shot towards the animal.  Depending on what surrounded you, you might have been ab le to get a nice, more solid background, maybe even some bokeh (see previous bokeh challenges).', '2006-12-10 02:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103503, 435291, 40718, '<td valign="top">The angle of the wrist ruins it for me a bit.  I do like the title and the composition.  Those look like clean nails though. :) 5</td>', 'The angle of the wrist ruins it for me a bit.  I do like the title and the composition.  Those look like clean nails though. :) 5', '2006-12-10 02:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
