(3103802, 435116, 64176, '<td valign="top">okay, i can''t help it-- i''m gonna give my honest opinion here.  this is disturbing, and not a good photo.  i''m sorry but i don''t want to see this.  what does the title mean?  why is the man poking at the dog?  background is too busy. photo is washed out in spots, and not in focus.  i don''t want to make any assumptions about this entry being sheerly for shock value and to piss people off, but there are a lot of animal lovers on this site. why would you want to do this to them?  1</td>', 'okay, i can''t help it-- i''m gonna give my honest opinion here.  this is disturbing, and not a good photo.  i''m sorry but i don''t want to see this.  what does the title mean?  why is the man poking at the dog?  background is too busy. photo is washed out in spots, and not in focus.  i don''t want to make any assumptions about this entry being sheerly for shock value and to piss people off, but there are a lot of animal lovers on this site. why would you want to do this to them?  1', '2006-12-10 10:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103803, 434134, 64176, '<td valign="top">:-(  poor Roo.  i''m gonna pretend he''s just napping there.</td>', ':-(  poor Roo.  i''m gonna pretend he''s just napping there.', '2006-12-10 10:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
