(3103813, 433965, 64176, '<td valign="top">I love the look he''s giving you and for me, the border works nicely in this one.  is the death the leaves though?  okay, nevermind. i just looked up harbinger on dictionary.com.  Got it: anything that foreshadows a future event; omen; sign. Cool pic, great title. thanks for teaching me a new word today!</td>', 'I love the look he''s giving you and for me, the border works nicely in this one.  is the death the leaves though?  okay, nevermind. i just looked up harbinger on dictionary.com.  Got it: anything that foreshadows a future event; omen; sign. Cool pic, great title. thanks for teaching me a new word today!', '2006-12-10 10:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
