(3103897, 435326, 64176, '<td valign="top">bummer that extra n got stuck in there and wasn''t it ''Quoth the raven, "nevermore"''. anyway, i get the meaning but i''m having trouble with the photo.  is the bird on the left dead?  he looks like he''s at a funny angle looking up at the other bird, whose wings are very strangely positioned.  and the pink smoke is a little distracting.  but for some reason, i can''t stop trying to solve this little puzzle and for that i give you kudos.  you drew me in. 7</td>', 'bummer that extra n got stuck in there and wasn''t it ''Quoth the raven, "nevermore"''. anyway, i get the meaning but i''m having trouble with the photo.  is the bird on the left dead?  he looks like he''s at a funny angle looking up at the other bird, whose wings are very strangely positioned.  and the pink smoke is a little distracting.  but for some reason, i can''t stop trying to solve this little puzzle and for that i give you kudos.  you drew me in. 7', '2006-12-10 11:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
