(3103928, 434339, 64176, '<td valign="top">heartwrenching.  definitely not out--they do not embody death, just age.  a wonderful group portrait depicting different stages of senior citizenship.  i want to hug them. i love that Santa is in the background watching over them.  i''m adding this to my favorites as i love photos of the elderly.</td>', 'heartwrenching.  definitely not out--they do not embody death, just age.  a wonderful group portrait depicting different stages of senior citizenship.  i want to hug them. i love that Santa is in the background watching over them.  i''m adding this to my favorites as i love photos of the elderly.', '2006-12-10 12:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
