(3105712, 435127, 68573, '<td valign="top">Great picture, nice concept- wondeful execution</td>', 'Great picture, nice concept- wondeful execution', '2006-12-11 06:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105716, 434941, 68573, '<td valign="top">wonderful</td>', 'wonderful', '2006-12-11 06:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105720, 434425, 68573, '<td valign="top">Very nice. A welcome change from skulls, blood,gore and churches</td>', 'Very nice. A welcome change from skulls, blood,gore and churches', '2006-12-11 06:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105766, 433453, 68573, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2006-12-11 07:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105769, 434339, 68573, '<td valign="top">Very emotive picture. everyone can relate to it</td>', 'Very emotive picture. everyone can relate to it', '2006-12-11 07:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105862, 435156, 24073, '<td valign="top">The interest factor is lacking here.  Just not a whole lot here to draw the viewer in, and keep the eyes focused.</td>', 'The interest factor is lacking here.  Just not a whole lot here to draw the viewer in, and keep the eyes focused.', '2006-12-11 08:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105865, 435181, 24073, '<td valign="top">Blurry, it almost looks out of focus.  The depth seems to be lacking in the same note.</td>', 'Blurry, it almost looks out of focus.  The depth seems to be lacking in the same note.', '2006-12-11 08:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105867, 434998, 24073, '<td valign="top">A little off center, but also not a rule of thirds composition.  I''m a little confused about the strategy, it makes me feel off balance.</td>', 'A little off center, but also not a rule of thirds composition.  I''m a little confused about the strategy, it makes me feel off balance.', '2006-12-11 08:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105877, 435117, 24073, '<td valign="top">Overall the image just doesn''t convey death to "me", but still a good image.  Well I''m not a huge scrooge when it comes to DNMC, but it will lack a point from me in that range.  As I said, still above avg.  GL&gt;</td>', 'Overall the image just doesn''t convey death to "me", but still a good image.  Well I''m not a huge scrooge when it comes to DNMC, but it will lack a point from me in that range.  As I said, still above avg.  GL>', '2006-12-11 08:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105884, 434634, 24073, '<td valign="top">The second such photo I have seen with similar visions.  I must admit, the idea is fantastic, and I like them both.  Ice, and flowers &lt;--let me jot that down. LOL.  GL, I really like it.</td>', 'The second such photo I have seen with similar visions.  I must admit, the idea is fantastic, and I like them both.  Ice, and flowers <--let me jot that down. LOL.  GL, I really like it.', '2006-12-11 09:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105887, 435059, 24073, '<td valign="top">As well, it should be.</td>', 'As well, it should be.', '2006-12-11 09:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105894, 434229, 24073, '<td valign="top">If we only knew, Im sort of hoping this isn''t the face though. LOL. Nice image.</td>', 'If we only knew, Im sort of hoping this isn''t the face though. LOL. Nice image.', '2006-12-11 09:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105917, 435177, 24073, '<td valign="top">Alright, now at this point I am sure you are getting hammered with DNMC.  And it doesn''t meet the challenge "typically".  As for me I hold alot of Native American philosophy sacred to my heart, in which one believes an aurora is created by souls leaving this world for the next.  I know this isn''t the aurora borealis, but it still stands true to the feeling it gives me about "death".  So in this case, 10+.  You should consider making this print available, even if it doesn''t win.  GL&gt;</td>', 'Alright, now at this point I am sure you are getting hammered with DNMC.  And it doesn''t meet the challenge "typically".  As for me I hold alot of Native American philosophy sacred to my heart, in which one believes an aurora is created by souls leaving this world for the next.  I know this isn''t the aurora borealis, but it still stands true to the feeling it gives me about "death".  So in this case, 10+.  You should consider making this print available, even if it doesn''t win.  GL>', '2006-12-11 09:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105925, 433689, 24073, '<td valign="top">I am typically not a fan of these shots, but you have done an amazing job at capturing this, and I simply love it.  The colors, the tones, the mood, the crisp clean focus, the depth.  I love it. GL.</td>', 'I am typically not a fan of these shots, but you have done an amazing job at capturing this, and I simply love it.  The colors, the tones, the mood, the crisp clean focus, the depth.  I love it. GL.', '2006-12-11 09:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105932, 434387, 24073, '<td valign="top">I knew there would be a fair share of gravestones in this challenge, hence the most of them lacking a point for creativity.  This one breaks that plane though, and is really the stand alone "1" I will remember of all the gravestones I have seen so far.  GL. 8.</td>', 'I knew there would be a fair share of gravestones in this challenge, hence the most of them lacking a point for creativity.  This one breaks that plane though, and is really the stand alone "1" I will remember of all the gravestones I have seen so far.  GL. 8.', '2006-12-11 09:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3105938, 435195, 24073, '<td valign="top">Alright dude freaky enough without the fact the first thing I seen was a childs face created by the subjects hand.  If you don''t see it at first distant yourself a bit from the monitor.  Too wierd.</td>', 'Alright dude freaky enough without the fact the first thing I seen was a childs face created by the subjects hand.  If you don''t see it at first distant yourself a bit from the monitor.  Too wierd.', '2006-12-11 09:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106081, 435000, 59029, '<td valign="top">a little too brutal for me</td>', 'a little too brutal for me', '2006-12-11 10:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106089, 434665, 59029, '<td valign="top">lovely capture</td>', 'lovely capture', '2006-12-11 10:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106090, 434341, 59029, '<td valign="top">no...why?</td>', 'no...why?', '2006-12-11 10:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106094, 434989, 59029, '<td valign="top">oh yum, what a way to go!</td>', 'oh yum, what a way to go!', '2006-12-11 10:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106096, 435264, 59029, '<td valign="top">even me?!</td>', 'even me?!', '2006-12-11 10:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106099, 434039, 59029, '<td valign="top">morbid but funny</td>', 'morbid but funny', '2006-12-11 10:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106101, 433354, 59029, '<td valign="top">looks like a painting...very nice</td>', 'looks like a painting...very nice', '2006-12-11 10:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
