(3106305, 434548, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been more effective if the hands seemed to be interacting with the face in some way, instead of just holding up the skull. 6</td>', 'I think this would have been more effective if the hands seemed to be interacting with the face in some way, instead of just holding up the skull. 6', '2006-12-11 12:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106339, 434376, 50695, '<td valign="top">those aren''t leaves! Nice composition, though. 6</td>', 'those aren''t leaves! Nice composition, though. 6', '2006-12-11 12:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106348, 435264, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is great - it gave me a laugh ;-)</td>', 'This is great - it gave me a laugh ;-)', '2006-12-11 12:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106349, 434122, 52549, '<td valign="top">Excellent.</td>', 'Excellent.', '2006-12-11 12:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106353, 435323, 52549, '<td valign="top">;-))) funny and good.</td>', ';-))) funny and good.', '2006-12-11 12:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106355, 435203, 52549, '<td valign="top">...probably undernourishment ;-) Cool shot (pardon the pun).</td>', '...probably undernourishment ;-) Cool shot (pardon the pun).', '2006-12-11 12:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106358, 434336, 52549, '<td valign="top">Frightening....</td>', 'Frightening....', '2006-12-11 12:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106359, 435325, 52549, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and composition (I have a rather morbid taste in colours ;-)</td>', 'Nice colours and composition (I have a rather morbid taste in colours ;-)', '2006-12-11 12:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106381, 434998, 52549, '<td valign="top">Good idea and it comes over well in b/w. The fading into the white distance is another good touch.</td>', 'Good idea and it comes over well in b/w. The fading into the white distance is another good touch.', '2006-12-11 12:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106385, 434882, 52549, '<td valign="top">I love the idea, just wish you''d chosen a different background. Good luck anyway.</td>', 'I love the idea, just wish you''d chosen a different background. Good luck anyway.', '2006-12-11 12:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106396, 434945, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think the crop is too tight for the sort of 19th century effect this has.</td>', 'I think the crop is too tight for the sort of 19th century effect this has.', '2006-12-11 12:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106473, 435159, 50695, '<td valign="top">I eventually figured out what the stuff on the left is, but it is too obscure.</td>', 'I eventually figured out what the stuff on the left is, but it is too obscure.', '2006-12-11 13:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106517, 434988, 50695, '<td valign="top">the man was a genius.</td>', 'the man was a genius.', '2006-12-11 13:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106559, 434542, 50695, '<td valign="top">Incredibly authentic art deco feel. Wow. Instant 10.</td>', 'Incredibly authentic art deco feel. Wow. Instant 10.', '2006-12-11 14:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106567, 435136, 50695, '<td valign="top">Gutsy (so to speak) and completely successful. The straining muscles seem to be doing just what you say, except I can''t imagine that anything could pierce that rocky flesh. 9</td>', 'Gutsy (so to speak) and completely successful. The straining muscles seem to be doing just what you say, except I can''t imagine that anything could pierce that rocky flesh. 9', '2006-12-11 14:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106569, 435242, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great use of noise. This person seems to be disintegrating into light, right before my eyes. 8</td>', 'Great use of noise. This person seems to be disintegrating into light, right before my eyes. 8', '2006-12-11 14:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106571, 433370, 50695, '<td valign="top">surreal, nice colors, and that sort of empty feeling I associate with death. 8</td>', 'surreal, nice colors, and that sort of empty feeling I associate with death. 8', '2006-12-11 14:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106574, 433629, 50695, '<td valign="top">I can''t make out what this is but it looks great. It looks like a tree of sorts. 8</td>', 'I can''t make out what this is but it looks great. It looks like a tree of sorts. 8', '2006-12-11 14:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106575, 434714, 50695, '<td valign="top">talk about subtle! I''ll give you a 7 just for having the eggs to submit something this subtle to dpc.</td>', 'talk about subtle! I''ll give you a 7 just for having the eggs to submit something this subtle to dpc.', '2006-12-11 14:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106576, 434896, 50695, '<td valign="top">This has to be the best cemetery shot of the competition. 8</td>', 'This has to be the best cemetery shot of the competition. 8', '2006-12-11 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106578, 435181, 50695, '<td valign="top">I almost passed this over and gave it a 5, thinking "just another homeless shot," but then I realized how perfect the composition is. The man is truly isolated in the middle of all this clamor. 8</td>', 'I almost passed this over and gave it a 5, thinking "just another homeless shot," but then I realized how perfect the composition is. The man is truly isolated in the middle of all this clamor. 8', '2006-12-11 14:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106581, 434936, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice processing, but really, Mary has been dead for 85 years. He should be over it by now. Seriously, though, that''s a great pose from the model. 8</td>', 'Nice processing, but really, Mary has been dead for 85 years. He should be over it by now. Seriously, though, that''s a great pose from the model. 8', '2006-12-11 14:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106584, 433682, 68256, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t resist voting very high for this, makes me laugh when I read that title.</td>', 'I couldn''t resist voting very high for this, makes me laugh when I read that title.', '2006-12-11 14:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106586, 435264, 50695, '<td valign="top">This picture simultaneously satirizes DPC and the Levantine religions. Well done! Oh, and it made me laugh. 8</td>', 'This picture simultaneously satirizes DPC and the Levantine religions. Well done! Oh, and it made me laugh. 8', '2006-12-11 14:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106589, 433432, 50695, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t quite come together, but a fascinating and mysterious composition. 8</td>', 'It doesn''t quite come together, but a fascinating and mysterious composition. 8', '2006-12-11 14:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106592, 434783, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love how the reflection makes him seem like he''s soaring. The composition is a little dull, though. 7</td>', 'I love how the reflection makes him seem like he''s soaring. The composition is a little dull, though. 7', '2006-12-11 14:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106595, 433043, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the pills stuck on his face and the noisy processing. 7</td>', 'I love the pills stuck on his face and the noisy processing. 7', '2006-12-11 14:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106596, 434163, 50695, '<td valign="top">Magical and lovely. 9</td>', 'Magical and lovely. 9', '2006-12-11 14:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106598, 435315, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best double exposures in this challenge. The dead version has black holes for eyes and the spirit version almost disappears in the noisiness of the picture. 8</td>', 'This is one of the best double exposures in this challenge. The dead version has black holes for eyes and the spirit version almost disappears in the noisiness of the picture. 8', '2006-12-11 14:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106600, 435191, 50695, '<td valign="top">You are evil. I see they were touring Europe. Perhaps they were driving on the wrong side of the road? I see that sonuvab1tc4 driving the white car wasn''t hurt. He''s probably the drunk that caused this accident. His wife went right through the windshield, though. At least, I hope that''s his wife and not some poor local prostitute he picked up. Life is absurd. 8</td>', 'You are evil. I see they were touring Europe. Perhaps they were driving on the wrong side of the road? I see that sonuvab1tc4 driving the white car wasn''t hurt. He''s probably the drunk that caused this accident. His wife went right through the windshield, though. At least, I hope that''s his wife and not some poor local prostitute he picked up. Life is absurd. 8', '2006-12-11 14:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106604, 434428, 50695, '<td valign="top">Not the most original idea but very well executed. It''s so hard to use the moon effectively in a photograph. 7</td>', 'Not the most original idea but very well executed. It''s so hard to use the moon effectively in a photograph. 7', '2006-12-11 14:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106605, 435326, 50695, '<td valign="top">I always give high scores to absurd Dada staged photos like this one. You''ve established an interesting relationship between the two birds. 8</td>', 'I always give high scores to absurd Dada staged photos like this one. You''ve established an interesting relationship between the two birds. 8', '2006-12-11 14:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106609, 434213, 50695, '<td valign="top">You''ve combined two bad things -- Infrared and Oversharpening -- to create a splendid effect. That is the essence of art! 8</td>', 'You''ve combined two bad things -- Infrared and Oversharpening -- to create a splendid effect. That is the essence of art! 8', '2006-12-11 14:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106612, 434989, 50695, '<td valign="top">are those christmas m&amp;ms going to... HELL??? No!!!! 7</td>', 'are those christmas m&ms going to... HELL??? No!!!! 7', '2006-12-11 14:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106614, 434900, 50695, '<td valign="top">You gotta love those bigcollared handraising people. Does that ladder lead to the mother ship? 7</td>', 'You gotta love those bigcollared handraising people. Does that ladder lead to the mother ship? 7', '2006-12-11 14:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106615, 435038, 50695, '<td valign="top">death is the asterisk, the wild card... 7 bump to 8</td>', 'death is the asterisk, the wild card... 7 bump to 8', '2006-12-11 14:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106617, 435319, 50695, '<td valign="top">There is something about diaphanous translucency that reminds me of death, too. Perhaps it evokes a transition to death, as things fall apart. Perhaps there is nothing more than a veil between life and death. 7</td>', 'There is something about diaphanous translucency that reminds me of death, too. Perhaps it evokes a transition to death, as things fall apart. Perhaps there is nothing more than a veil between life and death. 7', '2006-12-11 14:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106618, 435117, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t like most photos of sculptures. Most of the artistry comes from the sculptor. But you do a great service for this sculptor. 7</td>', 'I don''t like most photos of sculptures. Most of the artistry comes from the sculptor. But you do a great service for this sculptor. 7', '2006-12-11 14:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106619, 435091, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is the most "real" photo of the competition, even if it isn''t. But I think it is. 8</td>', 'This is the most "real" photo of the competition, even if it isn''t. But I think it is. 8', '2006-12-11 14:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106625, 435209, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love those slippers.<br/> <br/>Wow factor = 2<br/>Composition = 2<br/>Lighting = 1<br/>Texture = 1<br/>Slippers = 2<br/>Total: 8</td>', 'I love those slippers. Wow factor = 2Composition = 2Lighting = 1Texture = 1Slippers = 2Total: 8', '2006-12-11 14:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106640, 434797, 50695, '<td valign="top">You know, that looks so much like the actor that I checked Google to see if I could find the image. I figured you might have just used a cut-out and put a scythe in front of it. But I couldn''t find the image, so I''m giving you the benefit of the doubt. 8 for a great recreation, and a composition that I believe is original to you.</td>', 'You know, that looks so much like the actor that I checked Google to see if I could find the image. I figured you might have just used a cut-out and put a scythe in front of it. But I couldn''t find the image, so I''m giving you the benefit of the doubt. 8 for a great recreation, and a composition that I believe is original to you.', '2006-12-11 14:40:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3106641, 435009, 50695, '<td valign="top">you look like a very upset <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=40679" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">biteme</a>. I''ll give you a 7 if you don''t hurt me.</td>', 'you look like a very upset  biteme. I''ll give you a 7 if you don''t hurt me.', '2006-12-11 14:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106645, 435006, 50695, '<td valign="top">7 for making me laugh. I can''t score you higher because I hate blood, even ketchup blood.</td>', '7 for making me laugh. I can''t score you higher because I hate blood, even ketchup blood.', '2006-12-11 14:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106646, 435324, 50695, '<td valign="top">8 For such a weird and intriguing photo.</td>', '8 For such a weird and intriguing photo.', '2006-12-11 14:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106648, 434915, 50695, '<td valign="top">Let both realms inhabit you. 7</td>', 'Let both realms inhabit you. 7', '2006-12-11 14:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106649, 434134, 50695, '<td valign="top">It''s not irony, but it''s a good photo. 7</td>', 'It''s not irony, but it''s a good photo. 7', '2006-12-11 14:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106651, 435261, 50695, '<td valign="top">7 for cracking me up. Whoever made that toy cubicle is the true genius.</td>', '7 for cracking me up. Whoever made that toy cubicle is the true genius.', '2006-12-11 14:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106656, 435233, 50695, '<td valign="top">It''s the light and shadow that really make this work for me. 7</td>', 'It''s the light and shadow that really make this work for me. 7', '2006-12-11 14:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106657, 434387, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried similar shots with much less success. This is really lovely to look at. 8</td>', 'I''ve tried similar shots with much less success. This is really lovely to look at. 8', '2006-12-11 14:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106659, 434039, 50695, '<td valign="top">8 for the extra effort put in by your model. He''s really selling it.</td>', '8 for the extra effort put in by your model. He''s really selling it.', '2006-12-11 14:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106661, 435203, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the duotone(?) processing. Good composition. 8</td>', 'I like the duotone(?) processing. Good composition. 8', '2006-12-11 14:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106671, 434637, 50695, '<td valign="top">The hand gets lost in the highlights and shadows all around it. Mostly that''s a good thing, but it might be a little too absurd: it''s actually being reshaped. But I''ll still give this a 7 for an interesting, dramatically lit, minimalist scene.</td>', 'The hand gets lost in the highlights and shadows all around it. Mostly that''s a good thing, but it might be a little too absurd: it''s actually being reshaped. But I''ll still give this a 7 for an interesting, dramatically lit, minimalist scene.', '2006-12-11 14:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106675, 434199, 50695, '<td valign="top">There''s something so 70s about this... so, 7.</td>', 'There''s something so 70s about this... so, 7.', '2006-12-11 14:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106679, 433573, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice B-horror ambience to this. Not 50''s B movies, more like 70''s independent movies. 8</td>', 'Nice B-horror ambience to this. Not 50''s B movies, more like 70''s independent movies. 8', '2006-12-11 14:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106680, 435058, 50695, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t look like petit mort to me, but I do like the patch of sharp details in a sea of darkness. 7</td>', 'This doesn''t look like petit mort to me, but I do like the patch of sharp details in a sea of darkness. 7', '2006-12-11 14:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106706, 435209, 44877, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Very grainy and dull quality, though.</td>', 'Good composition. Very grainy and dull quality, though.', '2006-12-11 15:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106714, 434166, 44877, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.</td>', 'Very beautiful.', '2006-12-11 15:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106720, 434665, 44877, '<td valign="top">Nice - is that in your back yard? :o)Photo has a wonderful translucent clarity to it.</td>', 'Nice - is that in your back yard? :o)Photo has a wonderful translucent clarity to it.', '2006-12-11 15:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106729, 433940, 44877, '<td valign="top">... or in this case, beauty of death.</td>', '... or in this case, beauty of death.', '2006-12-11 15:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106739, 435038, 44877, '<td valign="top">Wooo - interesting perspective.</td>', 'Wooo - interesting perspective.', '2006-12-11 15:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106760, 435242, 44877, '<td valign="top">Wow.</td>', 'Wow.', '2006-12-11 15:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106770, 434896, 44877, '<td valign="top">I love this!</td>', 'I love this!', '2006-12-11 15:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106810, 434505, 44877, '<td valign="top">That is horrible.</td>', 'That is horrible.', '2006-12-11 15:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3106935, 435181, 44877, '<td valign="top">Great capture - with the people walking away...</td>', 'Great capture - with the people walking away...', '2006-12-11 15:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
