(3107100, 435315, 53316, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of some of my "haunted living room" series. (see portfolio if you want to take a look) I love the way you''ve done this, especially with the hollow looking eyes.  I love how it''s not a "perfect" double image.. does that make sense?  Instead of having the face at the top be completely detailed, it is featureless and spirit-like.  Lack of perfect focus as well as choice of grayscale also add to the mood.</td>', 'Reminds me of some of my "haunted living room" series. (see portfolio if you want to take a look) I love the way you''ve done this, especially with the hollow looking eyes.  I love how it''s not a "perfect" double image.. does that make sense?  Instead of having the face at the top be completely detailed, it is featureless and spirit-like.  Lack of perfect focus as well as choice of grayscale also add to the mood.', '2006-12-11 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
