(3110378, 434197, 35804, '<td valign="top">Of all the carcass images in the challenge, this is the one that caught my attention...it''s not horrific, bloody, sadistic or even cruel...death comes naturally and often invisibly...death can be "little" and often overlooked yet it is everywhere...this image somehow has a thoughtfulness about it...beautifully seen.</td>', 'Of all the carcass images in the challenge, this is the one that caught my attention...it''s not horrific, bloody, sadistic or even cruel...death comes naturally and often invisibly...death can be "little" and often overlooked yet it is everywhere...this image somehow has a thoughtfulness about it...beautifully seen.', '2006-12-12 20:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
