(3110854, 435330, 67697, '<td valign="top">In case anyone reads this - I was going for a different sort of death.  Not traditional as we usually think of it.  This was an abandoned bike and it struck me as the end of fun and innocence.  This bike was discarded for what reason?  Maybe an upgrade or a faster vehicle?  So yes this was abstract - but I don''t care.  It worked for me!</td>', 'In case anyone reads this - I was going for a different sort of death.  Not traditional as we usually think of it.  This was an abandoned bike and it struck me as the end of fun and innocence.  This bike was discarded for what reason?  Maybe an upgrade or a faster vehicle?  So yes this was abstract - but I don''t care.  It worked for me!', '2006-12-13 00:10:42.000000', NULL, 0),
