(3110961, 434512, 69008, '<td valign="top">Good trick, to win the "Death" theme with something that''s never lived. You know your stuff. You have an awesome place nearby to shoot this kind of images.</td>', 'Good trick, to win the "Death" theme with something that''s never lived. You know your stuff. You have an awesome place nearby to shoot this kind of images.', '2006-12-13 00:28:52.000000', NULL, 0),
