(3114030, 434810, 62095, '<td valign="top">Man, I gave this shot a 9.  I can''t understand those low ball votes.  I guess some people don''t understand the message that says DO NOT VOTE LOW FOR SHOTS THAT YOU THINK BREAK THE RULES.  Maybe they are simple and cannot process that information, so think "DUHhhhh, 3" or similar.  Who can say?  Definitely deserved more for that degree of work and for getting a noise-free image over that exposure (though obviously we voters wouldn''t know the exposure time).</td>', 'Man, I gave this shot a 9.  I can''t understand those low ball votes.  I guess some people don''t understand the message that says DO NOT VOTE LOW FOR SHOTS THAT YOU THINK BREAK THE RULES.  Maybe they are simple and cannot process that information, so think "DUHhhhh, 3" or similar.  Who can say?  Definitely deserved more for that degree of work and for getting a noise-free image over that exposure (though obviously we voters wouldn''t know the exposure time).', '2006-12-13 15:45:21.000000', NULL, 0),
