(3116449, 435181, 66597, '<td valign="top">Chris,<br/>I gave this a 7 when voting. I thought it was very well composed, especially for street (my favorite type of photography, but very difficult, I know). Obviously, it was the lack of focus that kept me from scoring it higher. You didn''t miss on the emotive or message, though, and thus it is a strong photo in my opinion even with the slight blur. Great job.</td>', 'Chris,I gave this a 7 when voting. I thought it was very well composed, especially for street (my favorite type of photography, but very difficult, I know). Obviously, it was the lack of focus that kept me from scoring it higher. You didn''t miss on the emotive or message, though, and thus it is a strong photo in my opinion even with the slight blur. Great job.', '2006-12-14 08:00:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3116493, 435181, 65035, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, you captured the emotion and told the story beautifully. Well done!</td>', 'I love this shot, you captured the emotion and told the story beautifully. Well done!', '2006-12-14 08:25:08.000000', NULL, 0),
