(3342173, 434353, 60862, '<td valign="top">I can''t help thinking the title should be "a bit of life in a sad place" because my attention goes right to the big tree in the foreground.  If you wanted to do that, then change the title. :)  If you want to make the orange tree the subject, surrounded by the always-interesting and emotional geometry of the gravestones, try it from another angle next time.  And give me a call when you''re here so we can shoot together! :)</td>', 'I can''t help thinking the title should be "a bit of life in a sad place" because my attention goes right to the big tree in the foreground.  If you wanted to do that, then change the title. :)  If you want to make the orange tree the subject, surrounded by the always-interesting and emotional geometry of the gravestones, try it from another angle next time.  And give me a call when you''re here so we can shoot together! :)', '2007-02-07 23:29:05.000000', NULL, 0),
